Publisher remains atomic per file, not as a batch, with best-effort concurrency checks and no automatic rollback.', 'The frozen11:50 Source002 snapshot selects constructor002 author freeze without a full peer in that cohort. Root later compactb35/source acceptance remains outside this cohort; no global absence or fresh primary factual update is inferred.'])
    post=[]
